Ah, it's cool to read about an ascention on the other side of the
fence....

The thing I like about this ascension report most of all is that it
doesn't even bother with all the things about Slashem I hate.  No Final
Fantasy references, no gypsys, no tales of killer shopkeepers (Nethack
merchants could stand a little strengthening, but not to Slashem's
degree).

The thing about your minions that caused them to not pick up items I
think is tied to the fact that minions, while similar to pets, are not
the same thing.  Like real-life cats, they don't "do" fetch.

